 An attitude EKF module: it subscribes to one gyro and one accel Vector, pairs them on one timestamp, and publishes the attitude plus diagnostics. The algorithm and the fusion scaffold ship together, one algorithm per repository, and multiple instances may coexist.
 
+
+## 使用教学
+
+要求XRobot 1.0.1、libxr 6.0.1、LibXR v2.0.1及C++20；BSP须已配置WDR模块索引并具备私有仓库读取权限。以下命令在BSP根目录执行。
+
+BSP须注册 ramfs；BMI088或DmImu先创建并发布两个同时间戳Vector。本例使用1kHz板载源，名义周期0.001s覆盖模块默认0.01s。
+
+```sh
+xrobot module add WDR-Xrobot-org/AttitudeEkf@same-or-dev
+xrobot setup
+xrobot instance add WDR-Xrobot-org/AttitudeEkf --id board_attitude
+```
+
+将添加的实例填成下面的完整参数映射，资源名换成BSP已注册对象。已有modules列表时只追加实例，不重复创建根键；输入发布者和依赖实例放在本实例之前。每个映射必须按字段声明顺序列全，不能靠省略字段缩短配置。
+
+```yaml
+modules:
+  - module: WDR-Xrobot-org/AttitudeEkf
+    id: board_attitude
+    args:
+      - ramfs: ramfs
+      - param:
+          dt_source: wdr_imu::DtSource::MEASURED
+          nominal_period_s: 0.001f
+          task_stack_depth: 4096
+          gyro_topic_name: "bmi088_gyro"
+          accel_topic_name: "bmi088_accl"
+          output_topic_name: "board_attitude"
+          diagnostics_topic_name: "board_fusion_diagnostics"
+          command_name: "attitude"
+```
+
+构造接口（所有依赖对象的生命周期须覆盖实例）：
+
+```cpp
+AttitudeEkf(LibXR::RamFS& ramfs,
+       const Param& param = {.dt_source = wdr_imu::DtSource::MEASURED,
+                            .nominal_period_s = 0.01f,
+                            .task_stack_depth = 4096,
+                            .gyro_topic_name = "bmi088_gyro",
+                            .accel_topic_name = "bmi088_accl",
+                            .output_topic_name = "board_attitude",
+                            .diagnostics_topic_name = "board_fusion_diagnostics",
+                            .command_name = "attitude"});
+```
+
+构造默认实参与字段默认值保持一致；BSP示例中的覆盖值不等于模块默认值。
+
+| Param字段 | 类型 | 源码字段默认值 | 单位与作用 |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `dt_source` | `wdr_imu::DtSource` | `wdr_imu::DtSource::MEASURED` | MEASURED使用相邻输入时间戳；FIXED显式使用名义周期 |
+| `nominal_period_s` | `float` | `0.01f` | s；首拍和FIXED步长，MEASURED钳制基准（1/4至3倍） |
+| `task_stack_depth` | `uint32_t` | `4096` | 字节；解算/控制线程栈 |
+| `gyro_topic_name` | `const char*` | `"bmi088_gyro"` | 输入Vector；rad/s，机构坐标 |
+| `accel_topic_name` | `const char*` | `"bmi088_accl"` | 输入Vector；m/s²，含重力，机构坐标 |
+| `output_topic_name` | `const char*` | `"board_attitude"` | 姿态或底盘状态输出Topic |
+| `diagnostics_topic_name` | `const char*` | `"board_fusion_diagnostics"` | 诊断计数输出Topic |
+| `command_name` | `const char*` | `"attitude"` | RamFS命令名；多实例使用不同名称 |
+
+配置后重新生成入口：
+
+```sh
+xrobot gen -c User/xrobot.yaml
+```
+
+若配置放在另一份User YAML中，-c选择该文件。按BSP文档构建、烧录与验证。`attitude show`/`attitude diag`观察姿态及配对/丢样计数，姿态输出为board_attitude。 软件编译与主机回归不代表硬件或机构已通过验收。
+
+本次公开接口迁移方式见[迁移说明](docs/migration.md)。
